            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[- Added an Open at Login option in Settings.
- New drafts now place the caret in the title automatically, and Return moves directly into the editor.
- Keyboard Shortcuts can now be dismissed with Esc even when the editor has keyboard focus.
- Fixed a save failure on fresh installations when Draftava's local Application Support folder had not yet been created.
]]></description>
